Shop, toy purchases, restore-purchase entry points, ad-removal buttons and promotions are
omitted from drawing and input. This does not grant paid entitlements. Advertising,
payment, account and online platform SDKs are not loaded by this offline host.
News is omitted from rendering and input as well. The package excludes unused
store and game-over promotional assets; original gameplay textures retain their bytes.

Peripheral scenery uses crops of the original gametiles_L.png and live bck_ paper;
crop coordinates and paper projection are recorded in scenery.py. The added app
icon and cursor are separate new assets. Shipping PNG files retain their creation prompts in metadata.

